==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Having a lot of Meatshields can heavily help out on this stage, as they will have a easier time surviving the nuke that Director Kurosawah delivers on occassion. Other than that, just kill Director Kurosawah and clean up the rest. Any good Anti-Dark or generally fast attacker can be used here for cleanup, including [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], or [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl/Pizza Cat]].

